# Line endings are load-bearing here.
#
# The bodies in lib/prompts/ are shipped to the model verbatim, and
# test/prompts.test.js rejects a CR anywhere in them. `core.autocrlf=true`
# (the usual Windows default, and the setting on the machine this was written
# on) rewrites text files to CRLF on checkout, which would silently turn a
# passing build into a failing one after a fresh clone. Pin LF for every text
# file in this repository, whatever the host configuration says.
* text=auto eol=lf
